he secrets of this strangely familiar world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/8ee5379875724d8190abb5a597d154b5.avif?t=1769105231\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dark depths you will encounter the long forgotten experiments that were created in The Lab, they'll hunt you, chase you, and make sure you never feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its up to you whether you try to hide, try to run, or try to fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DoodleCorp"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/59ae27efc7e2f428becbdf3c7be7dbf7fc5ec5b9/header.jpg?t=1769105231","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897890/1845429295/b1db50ead92e394b001961eccbdcdb1d7b31ba1a/1753206866/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753895008","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897890/1845429295/b1db50ead92e394b001961eccbdcdb1d7b31ba1a/1753206866/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753895008","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897890/1845429295/b1db50ead92e394b001961eccbdcdb1d7b31ba1a/1753206866/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753895008","id":257172466,"name":"Depths Unseen Chapter I Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172466/dee25f0b8a4027c6482413144272a695043b111b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753895008"}],"name":"Depths Unseen","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>